PTX pdl-early-trigger+no-wait
"Variant of pdl-early-trigger+raw where the dependent reads without griddepcontrol.wait: launch_dependents is only a scheduling hint (grid_dependency_control.h:80-83). Expected: allowed."
{
x=0;
P1:r0=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,gpu 0,grid 0            | P1@cta 0,gpu 0,grid 1 ;
 griddepcontrol.launch_dependents | ld.weak.global r0, x  ;
 st.weak.global x, 1              |                       ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 0)
